.SH BUGS
Only
.I rtl_tcp
is a source; there is no driver of its own for the dongle.
A first reader more than
.B -l
seconds after the last waits the five seconds
.I rtl_tcp
takes to take a new client.
.PP
One dongle a server; a second is a second
.I sdrfs
at another mount point.
.PP
.I Rtl_tcp
answers no command, so a setting the dongle cannot take (a frequency
beyond its tuner, a bias tee it does not have) is not refused here.
